  (10, 'COMPUTE', 'Compute and cluster sizing', 'ALL_PURPOSE_CLASSIC', 'Classic all-purpose cluster cost (configured cluster)', 'LAKEMETER_FUNCTION', 'estimate_all_purpose_classic_cost', 'AVAILABLE', 'UNTESTED', 'The user explicitly supplies or asks about a configured classic all-purpose cluster.', 'Cloud, region, tier, driver/worker node types, worker count, Photon choice, run frequency and runtime.', 'Lakemeter DBU price card (GOVERNED/REFERENCE_ONLY/PENDING) plus cloud VM on-demand list price.', 'Regions depend on configured price_regions and loaded reference data.', 'Function exists; no product-specific agent benchmark is present in this repository.', 'sql/02_functions.sql; README.md Notes; validation inventory through 2026-10-29.', '2026-10-29'),
  (10, 'COMPUTE', 'Compute and cluster sizing', 'DLT_CLASSIC', 'Classic Lakeflow Declarative Pipelines cluster cost', 'LAKEMETER_FUNCTION', 'estimate_dlt_classic_cost', 'AVAILABLE', 'UNTESTED', 'The user explicitly asks about a configured classic pipeline and gives its edition and cluster details.', 'Cloud, region, tier, pipeline edition, driver/worker types, worker count, Photon choice, run frequency and runtime.', 'Lakemeter DBU price card (GOVERNED/REFERENCE_ONLY/PENDING) plus cloud VM on-demand list price.', 'Regions depend on configured price_regions and loaded reference data.', 'Function exists; no product-specific agent benchmark is present in this repository.', 'sql/02_functions.sql; validation inventory through 2026-10-29.', '2026-10-29'),
