  (20, 'SQL', 'SQL and analytics', 'DCP_SQL_REPORTING', 'DCP SQL reporting workload estimate', 'DCP_CALCULATOR', 'dcp_calc_totals, dcp_calc_line_items, dcp_calc_details', 'AVAILABLE', 'PARTIAL', 'DCP SQL/reporting cost described by concurrent users and working days, not a configured warehouse size.', 'Concurrent users and working days; confirm other DCP areas.', 'DCP SQL Pro rate card with explicit rate status and source.', 'DCP registry currently covers US_EAST_1.', 'A benchmark question covers SQL reporting; broader parity is not established.', 'Workbook B9; benchmark Q11; latest full run 2026-10-28.', '2026-10-29'),
