  (30, 'CLOUD_DATA', 'Cloud data transfer and storage', 'DCP_DATASYNC', 'AWS DataSync transfer and migration estimate', 'DCP_CALCULATOR', 'dcp_calc_totals, dcp_calc_line_items, dcp_calc_details', 'AVAILABLE', 'PARTIAL', 'DataSync daily transfer or a one-time migration in a DCP estimate.', 'Daily GB range, transfer days, and any initial migration GB; confirm other DCP areas.', 'DCP AWS rate registry; rate status/source are returned on line items.', 'AWS US_EAST_1 registry.', 'The calculator can price this area; the latest full Genie benchmark had a first-turn area-confirmation failure for Q13.', 'Workbook A8 and C13; benchmark Q13; latest full run 2026-10-28.', '2026-10-29'),
