  (40, 'AI_SERVING', 'AI, models, and serving', 'FMAPI_DATABRICKS', 'Databricks Foundation Model API configured cost', 'LAKEMETER_FUNCTION', 'estimate_fmapi_databricks_cost', 'AVAILABLE', 'UNTESTED', 'The user explicitly asks for a Databricks Foundation Model API product estimate by model and token/rate type.', 'Cloud, region, tier, model, rate type and token/usage quantity.', 'Lakemeter model/API pricing reference data; verify function status and source in output.', 'Regions depend on configured reference data.', 'Do not confuse a configured product estimate with a DCP workload estimate.', 'sql/02_functions.sql; validation inventory through 2026-10-29.', '2026-10-29'),
